OL,3,GNEWSAVictim loses #250k after scammers
OL,4,Ause AI video of 'well-known' celebrity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA person has lost #250,000 after
OL,7,Ffalling victim to an AI-generated scam.
OL,9,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,10,F(PSNI) said the victim saw what
OL,11,Fappeared to be an AI-generated video
OL,12,Ffeaturing a well-known personality from
OL,13,Fthe financial sector.
OL,15,FThe advertisement promoted an
OL,16,Finvestment opportunity and claimed
OL,17,Fsignificant returns.
OL,19,FA spokesperson for the PSNI said an
OL,20,F"apparent celebrity endorsement" should
OL,21,Fnever be regarded as proof that an
OL,22,Finvestment is genuine.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
